flowchart TB
    subgraph Context[Context: Proofwall]
        Owner[Владелец] --> Product[Proofwall UI и API]
        Visitor[Автор отзыва] --> Product
        Reader[Читатель] --> Host[Внешний сайт с widget]
        Host --> Product
    end
    subgraph Containers[Containers: существующие границы]
        Web[Next web] --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
        Web --> S3[Private S3 photo storage]
        Widget[Vanilla widget Shadow DOM] --> Web
    end
    Product -.-> Web
    Host -.-> Widget
    subgraph Components[Components: изменяемая область]
        Project[Existing project page nav] --> Page[Branding server page]
        Page --> Editor[BrandingEditor + BrandingView]
        Editor --> Route[GET/PATCH branding route]
        Route --> Session[currentAccountId]
        Route --> Repo[readOwnedBranding / patchOwnedBranding]
        Repo --> Tenant[withAccount: RLS + tenant GUC]
        Route --> Validation[Canonical reader / patch validator]
        Collect[CollectView + existing SubmitForm] --> Intake[Existing testimonials API]
        Public[Wall + widget config] --> Defaults[Canonical Branding defaults]
    end
    Tenant --> PG
    Intake --> PG
    Intake --> S3
    Public --> PG
    subgraph QA[Отдельная QA граница]
        Runner[Dedicated allowlist runner] --> QaWeb[Worktree Next process]
        QaWeb --> QaPG[(Выделенный loopback proofwall_ui_test)]
        QaWeb --> QaS3[Synthetic local S3-compatible service]
        Fixture[Offline production view renderer] --> Frozen[Read-only dashboard-v3 PNG/JSON]
    end
